      "prompt": "You are helping with the following request:\n\nbuild me a simple farming loop\n\nRespond using exactly these markdown section headers, in this order, each followed by concise content (use bullet points where helpful):\n\n## Overview\n## Key Components\n## Dependencies\n## Open Questions\n\nDo not add any extra top-level headers or preamble text before the first header.",
      "response": "## Overview\n- A farming loop simulates basic agricultural activities.\n- It could track resources like seeds, water, and harvests.\n- The loop iterates over seasons or days to simulate growth cycles.\n\n## Key Components\n- Resource management (seeds, water, fertilizer).\n- Plant growth simulation.\n- Harvesting mechanism.\n- Simple user interaction for actions like planting or watering.\n\n## Dependencies\n- Basic programming language support (e.g., Python).\n- Optional: graphics library for visual representation (e.g., Pygame).\n\n## Open Questions\n- How will the growth rate be determined?\n- What kind of user input should be handled?\n- How will the game's progression be measured?",
