      "response": "```js\n// Define personality traits and their descriptions\r\nconst personalityTraits = {\r\n  Openness: \"Openness refers to the degree of curiosity, creativity, and imagination a person possesses. People who score high in openness are often described as adventurous, intellectual, and open-minded.\",\r\n  Conscientiousness: \"Conscientiousness involves the ability to control impulses, be organized, and meet obligations. High scores in conscientiousness are associated with reliability, discipline, and a strong work ethic.\",\r\n  Extraversion: \"Extraversion describes the extent to which a person is sociable, energetic, and assertive. Extraverted individuals tend to seek out social interactions, enjoy being around others, and derive energy from group activities.\",\r\n  Agreeableness: \"Agreeableness reflects a person's tendency to be cooperative, kind, and empathetic towards others. High agreeableness is associated with warmth, friendliness, and a willingness to compromise.\",\r\n  Neuroticism: \"Neuroticism measures the degree of emotional instability and vulnerability a person experiences. Individuals who score high in neuroticism may be more prone to anxiety, mood swings, and negative emotions.\"\r\n};\r\n\r\n// Define neurodivergent types and their descriptions\r\nconst neurodivergentTypes = {\r\n  Autism: \"Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD) is a neurodevelopmental condition characterized by difficulties with social interaction, communication, and repetitive behaviors. People with autism may have unique strengths in areas such as pattern recognition and attention to detail.\",\r\n  ADHD: \"Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD) is a neurodevelopmental condition marked by inattention, hyperactivity, and impulsivity. Individuals with ADHD may struggle with focus, organization, and self-regulation but can also possess creative and energetic qualities.\",\r\n  Dyslexia: \"Dyslexia is a learning disability that affects reading, writing, and spelling skills. People with dyslexia may have trouble decoding words and processing written information but often excel in areas such as visual-spatial tasks and problem-solving.\",\r\n  Anxiety: \"Anxiety disorders involve excessive fear, worry, or nervousness that can interfere with daily functioning. Common anxiety disorders include generalized anxiety disorder, panic disorder, and social anxiety disorder. People with anxiety may experience physical symptoms like rapid heartbeat and trembling.\",\r\n  Depression: \"Depression is a mood disorder characterized by persistent feelings of sadness, hopelessness, and loss of interest. Symptoms can include changes in appetite, sleep disturbances, and difficulty concentrating. Depression can significantly impact a person's quality of life and relationships.\"\r\n};\r\n\r\n// Function to display trait descriptions\r\nfunction displayTraitDescription(traitName, category) {\r\n  const description = category === 'Personality' ? personalityTraits[traitName] : neurodivergentTypes[traitName];\r\n  console.log(description);\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Main function to iterate over traits and display descriptions\r\nfunction displayPersonalityAndNeurodivergentTraits() {\r\n  console.log(\"Personality Traits:\");\r\n  for (const traitName in personalityTraits) {\r\n    console.log(`\\n${traitName}:`);\r\n    displayTraitDescription(traitName, 'Personality');\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  console.log(\"\\nNeurodivergent Types:\");\r\n  for (const traitName in neurodivergentTypes) {\r\n    console.log(`\\n${traitName}:`);\r\n    displayTraitDescription(traitName, 'Neurodivergent');\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Handle keyboard interrupts gracefully\r\nprocess.on('SIGINT', () => {\r\n  console.log(\"\\nExiting...\");\r\n  process.exit(0);\r\n});\r\n\r\n// Run the main function\r\ndisplayPersonalityAndNeurodivergentTraits();\n```",
