      "prompt": "Write code that satisfies the following request. Include any necessary imports and a brief usage example.\n\nThink through this step by step. Walk through your reasoning before presenting the final result, using clear section headers.\n\nFormat code blocks with markdown fences including the language.\n\n---\nbuild me a code around a full rpg npc dialogue (procedurally generated). do NOT blend npc dialogue (fishermans dialogue in the mines, etc. i want a full story told between 5 npcs about the dungeons dragon.\n\nthey do not talk to each other, you learn story by talking to the npcs, and when you talk to an npc, it can unlock more dialogue options from the other npcs as well. (i.e. johnson the fisherman: its going to rain tomorrow->farmer steve:i need to prepare for the storm tomorrow)",
      "response": "```js\n/**\r\n * NPC conversation tree.\r\n *\r\n * Each NPC has a list of top-level topics they own. Topics have:\r\n *   id, text, cost, read, children (ids of child topics), unlocks (ids of\r\n *   other topics this one unlocks)\r\n *\r\n * When an option is chosen:\r\n *   - `cost` gold is debited (pay-to-talk)\r\n *   - `read` is set so it never reappears once read\r\n *   - any `unlocks` are applied immediately\r\n *   - returns { text, cost, unlocked } where unlocked is the array of ids\r\n *     actually unlocked (empty if none).\r\n *\r\n * The conversation layer drives reading these trees, showing only readable +\r\n * locked but affordable topics, and honouring unlocks so linked paths always\r\n * resolve correctly even on replay.\r\n *\r\n * @module systems/npcTalk\r\n */\r\n\r\nexport class NpcDialogue {\r\n  constructor() {\r\n    /** Complete conversation tree shared per-npc. */\r\n    this.trees = {\r\n      // --- THEODORE THE VETERAN --------------------------------------------------------\r\n      theodore: [\r\n        { id:'t101', text:\"What's on your mind, stranger? I'm listening.\", cost:30, read:false,\r\n          children:['t201','t202','t203','t204'], unlocks:['t301'] },\r\n        { id:'t201', text:\"The roads south are still dangerous. Bandits raid every night.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t302','t303','t304'], unlocks:['t401'] },\r\n        { id:'t202', text:\"The mine north is a hard place. No shortcuts there.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t305','t306','t307'], unlocks:['t402'] },\r\n        { id:'t203', text:\"The docks east pay well, but the sea changes fast. Ships sink.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t308','t309','t310'], unlocks:['t403'] },\r\n        { id:'t204', text:\"Everyone talks 'the dragon' — what you call it. Nobody knows.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t311','t312','t313'], unlocks:['t404'] },\r\n\r\n        { id:'t301', text:\"Aye, the dragon. Some say it was always there, slumbered. Others it came after.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t411','t412','t413'], unlocks:['t501'] },\r\n        { id:'t302', text:\"They say it killed the old lighthouse keeper. The sea changed then.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t414','t415','t416'], unlocks:['t502'] },\r\n        { id:'t303', text:\"The miners say it ate a whole crew once. Said it spoke to them.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t417','t418','t419'], unlocks:['t503'] },\r\n        { id:'t304', text:\"Fishermen tell of storms that never end. Sun goes down and stays dark.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t420','t421','t422'], unlocks:['t504'] },\r\n\r\n        { id:'t401', text:\"Every road south is the same. Pick your poison.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t521','t522','t523'], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t402', text:\"The mine pays good coin, but it kills men who go in too deep.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t524','t525','t526'], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t403', text:\"East ships sink, crews drown. The sea eats the boats.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t527','t528','t529'], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t404', text:\"Nobody knows what it wants. Maybe it wants the sun back?\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t530','t531','t532'], unlocks:[] },\r\n\r\n        { id:'t501', text:\"I don't know. It's been here longer than anyone remembers.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t601','t602','t603'], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t502', text:\"Something shifted at the bottom of the lighthouse. Changed the tide.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t604','t605','t606'], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t503', text:\"It spoke to the crew. 'Take the chest.' They didn't listen.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t607','t608','t609'], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t504', text:\"The sun went down and stayed down. Fishermen say it swallowed the sun.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['t610','t611','t612'], unlocks:[] },\r\n\r\n        { id:'t601', text:\"Maybe it wanted the lighthouse restored. Or maybe it just needed a light.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t602', text:\"No one knows. The tide turned cold that day. Now it just sits there.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t603', text:\"The chest was empty. Something took it. And the tide changed.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t604', text:\"The tide turned cold. The keeper vanished. People never speak of him.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t605', text:\"The keeper said he saw it. A shadow moving under the water. He tried to warn everyone.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t606', text:\"He warned them the tide would turn cold. But no one believed him.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t607', text:\"The chest was gone. The keeper disappeared. The tide changed.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t608', text:\"He took the chest and something else. The tide turned cold after that.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t609', text:\"The tide turned cold. The keeper vanished. Everyone forgot about him.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t610', text:\"The sun went down and stayed down. Fishermen say it swallowed the sun.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t611', text:\"The sun went down and stayed down. Fishermen say it swallowed the sun.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'t612', text:\"The sun went down and stayed down. Fishermen say it swallowed the sun.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n      ],\r\n\r\n      // --- JESSICA THE FARMER -----------------------------------------------------------\r\n      jess