 read:false,\r\n          children:['j429','j430','j431'], unlocks:['j507'] },\r\n\r\n        { id:'j401', text:\"Every field needs water. Every morning. The wells run dry.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['j511','j512','j513'], unlocks:['j601'] },\r\n        { id:'j402', text:\"Peaceful days. The children play. The market sells. Life moves on.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['j514','j515','j516'], unlocks:['j602'] },\r\n        { id:'j403', text:\"Storms eat the roads. Travel slows. More dangerous. Water is key.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['j517','j518','j519'], unlocks:['j603'] },\r\n        { id:'j404', text:\"Bandits raid every night. Road south is slow. The dragon watches.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['j520','j521','j522'], unlocks:['j604'] },\r\n        { id:'j405', text:\"Buy goods at the market. Prices vary. Sell for gold. Water first.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['j523','j524','j525'], unlocks:['j605'] },\r\n        { id:'j406', text:\"Keep the children safe. Playtime is worth the work. The farm runs on them.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['j526','j527','j528'], unlocks:['j606'] },\r\n        { id:'j407', text:\"Water is everything. Cold nights kill crops. Heat dries them. Every field needs it.\", read:false,\r\n          children:['j529','j530','j531'], unlocks:['j607'] },\r\n\r\n        { id:'j501', text:\"The dragon... it's been here longer than anyone remembers.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'j502', text:\"The wells run dry. Every field needs water now. Pay the rancher.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'j503', text:\"We lost our son. One of the bandits. The children miss him.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'j504', text:\"The storms eat the roads. Travel slows. More dangerous. Water is key.\", read:false,\r\n          children:[], unlocks:[] },\r\n        { id:'j505', text:\"Goods at the mark