      "prompt": "Explain what the following code does. Cover its overall purpose, then walk through the important parts.\n\nBe direct and concise. Lead with the result/code and keep explanation to a minimum.\n\nFormat code blocks with markdown fences including the language.\n\n---\nYou09:07 AM\n\nif i were a parent in a video game and i had a baby, what would the code look like to have the baby---> all the way to full seperate npc (new npc=no code for it before it exists right?)\n\nOllama (local)09:07 AM204 tok\n\n// ── Baby ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nfunction spawnBaby() {\n  const b = BABIES[babyIdx];\n  if (!b) return;\n  babyState = 'pregnant'; babyTimer = b.pregnancyDays;\n  babyName = b.name; babyGender = b.gender;\n  showMsg(`Baby ${babyGender === 'boy' ? 'boy' : 'girl'} is growing inside you! (${b.pregnancyDays}d)`);\n}\n\n\nnow build me the npc code of the new baby+growing up to adulthood",
      "response": "```js\n// ── Baby ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nlet babyState = null; // 'pregnant'|'birthed'|'growing'|'adult'\nlet babyIdx    = 0;   // current baby index\nlet babyTimer  = 0;   // countdown to birth\nlet babyName   = '';  // name from baby list\nlet babyGender = '';  // 'boy'|'girl'\n\nconst BABIES = [\n  { name:'Ella', gender:'girl', pregnancyDays:18 },\n  { name:'Leo',  gender:'boy',  pregnancyDays:20 },\n];\n\nfunction spawnBaby() {\n  const b = BABIES[babyIdx];\n  if (!b) return;\n  babyState = 'pregnant'; babyTimer = b.pregnancyDays;\n  babyName = b.name; babyGender = b.gender;\n  showMsg(`Baby ${babyGender === 'boy' ? 'boy' : 'girl'} is growing inside you! (${b.pregnancyDays}d)`);\n}\n\nfunction tickBaby(dt) {\n  if (!babyState || babyState !== 'pregnant') return;\n  babyTimer -= dt;\n  if (babyTimer <= 0) {\n    babyState = 'birthed';\n    spawnChildNPC(babyGender);\n    babyIdx++;\n    showMsg(`Baby ${babyName} has been born! They're now an NPC.`);\n    babyName = ''; babyGender = '';\n  }\n}\n\nfunction spawnChildNPC(gender) {\n  const n = NPCs.length + 1;\n  const x = Math.floor(Math.random() * (W - 32)) + 16;\n  const y = Math.floor(Math.random() * (H - 32)) + 16;\n  const def = gender === 'boy' ? BERTO : LILY;\n  NPCs.push({\n    ...def,\n    id: `child_${n}`, x, y, hpMax: def.hpMax * 0.5, hp:def.hpMax * 0.5,\n    name: gender === 'boy' ? 'Berto Jr.' : 'Lily',\n    type:'npc', alive:true, moving:false, direction:'down', state:'idle',\n    talkOpen:false, _talkIdx:0, _walkTimer:0, _waitTimer:0, _homeX:x, _homeY:y,\n    _hungryTimer:0, _thirstyTimer:0, _restTimer:0, _hungerPct:100, _thirstPct:100,\n    _debt:0, _debtDay:0, _debtPaid:false,\n    _gender:gender, _age:0, _stage:'child', _growStage:0, _growTimer:0,\n    _growThresholds:[{pct:20,day:1},{pct:40,day:3},{pct:60,day:7},{pct:80,day:14}],\n  });\n}\n```",
