      "prompt": "Analyze the following code for performance issues and rewrite it to be more efficient. Explain the bottlenecks and the improvements made.\n\nBe direct and concise. Lead with the result/code and keep explanation to a minimum.\n\nFormat code blocks with markdown fences including the language.\n\n---\nOllama (local)08:38 AM8718 tok\n\nCODEBLOCK0javascript // Fine-tuned racing game with a boost mechanic, an inverted-controls banana bonus, // and a heart-shaped 3-lap track. // // Key components: // - Player car physics // - Track generation (heart shape) // - Boost system // - Banana bonus // - Inverted controls // - Lap counter // - Timer // - Scoring // - User interface // - Game loop // - Collision detection // - Audio feedback // - Responsive design for mobile/tablet/desktop // // Dependencies: Phaser 3 library, WebAudio API for audio, modern browser (ES6+ features)\n\nconst G = { // Tuning constants — tweak these to balance difficulty BOOST_DURATION: 0.85, // seconds BOOST_STRENGTH: 240, // pixels per second BONUS_DURATION: 1.5, // seconds CAR_WIDTH: 24, CAR_HEIGHT: 14, TRACK_WIDTH: 380, TRACK_HEIGHT: 260, MAX_SPEED: 400, ACCELERATION: 750, DECELERATION: 1200, TURN_RATE: 0.09, GRAVITY: 1400, JUMP_FORCE: 850, LANE_COUNT: 3, LANE_OFFSET: [0, 40, -40], BONUS_RADIUS: 8, BONUS_PULL: 800, TIMER_MAX: 60, LAP_REWARD: 1500, TIME_REWARD: 200, SPEED_REWARD: 250, BOOST_REWARD: 120, BONUS_REWARD: 180, CRASH_PENALTY: -400, START_TIMEOUT: 1.5, END_FADE_TIME: 1.2,\n\n// State flags running: false, started: false, inBonus: false, boostActive: false, gameOver: false, inputLocked: false, score: 0, lapCount: 0, timer: 0, maxTimer: G.TIMER_MAX, playerX: G.TRACK_WIDTH / 2, playerY: G.TRACK_HEIGHT / 2, playerAngle: 0, playerSpeed: 0, playerBoostLeft: 0, lastInput: null, };\n\n// Phaser config const config = { type: Phaser.AUTO, width: window.innerWidth, height: window.innerHeight, backgroundColor: '#0c0e10', scale: { mode: Phaser.Scale.NONE }, physics: { default: 'arcade', arcade: { gravity: { y: 0 }, debug: false } }, scene: { preload, create, update, render, startGame, showEndScreen, restartGame, }, }; const ph = new Phaser.Game(config);\n\nfunction preload() { // Load assets here this.load.spritesheet('player', 'assets/player.png', { frameWidth: G.CAR_WIDTH, frameHeight: G.CAR_HEIGHT }); this.load.spritesheet('wall', 'assets/wall.png', { frameWidth: 8, frameHeight: 8 }); this.load.audio('engine', 'assets/engine.ogg'); this.load.audio('boom', 'assets/boom.ogg'); }\n\nfunction create() { const cam = this.cameras.main; cam.setBounds(0, 0, G.TRACK_WIDTH, G.TRACK_HEIGHT); this.physics.world.setBoundsCollision(true);\n\n// Create ground layer const wallGroup = this.add.group(); function addWall(x1, y1, x2, y2) { const w = Math.abs(x2-x1), h = Math.abs(y2-y1); const sx = Math.min(x1,x2), sy = Math.min(y1,y2); const line = wallGroup.create(sx, sy, 'wall'); line.displayWidth = w; line.displayHeight = h; line.rotation = Math.atan2(h,w); }\n\n// Heart shape walls — two overlapping loops addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80); addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80); addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80); addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80); addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2); addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2); addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n\n// Lane boundaries addWall(-G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, -G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80); addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH-G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH-G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n\n// Spawn point const spawnX = G.TRACK_WIDTH/2 + G.LANE_OFFSET[1]; const spawnY = G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2;\n\n// Player car const playerCar = this.physics.add.sprit",
      "response": "```js\nconst G = {\n  BOOST_DURATION: 0.85,\n  BOOST_STRENGTH: 240,\n  BONUS_DURATION: 1.5,\n  CAR_WIDTH: 24, CAR_HEIGHT: 14,\n  TRACK_WIDTH: 380, TRACK_HEIGHT: 260,\n  MAX_SPEED: 400,\n  ACCELERATION: 750, DECELERATION: 1200,\n  TURN_RATE: 0.09, GRAVITY: 1400,\n  JUMP_FORCE: 850,\n  LANE_COUNT: 3, LANE_OFFSET: [0, 40, -40],\n  BONUS_RADIUS: 8, BONUS_PULL: 800,\n  TIMER_MAX: 60,\n  LAP_REWARD: 1500, TIME_REWARD: 200, SPEED_REWARD: 250,\n  BOOST_REWARD: 120, BONUS_REWARD: 180,\n  CRASH_PENALTY: -400,\n  START_TIMEOUT: 1.5, END_FADE_TIME: 1.2,\n  running: false, started: false, inBonus: false, boostActive: false, gameOver: false, inputLocked: false,\n  score: 0, lapCount: 0, timer: 0, maxTimer: G.TIMER_MAX,\n  playerX: G.TRACK_WIDTH / 2, playerY: G.TRACK_HEIGHT / 2,\n  playerAngle: 0, playerSpeed: 0, playerBoostLeft: 0,\n  lastInput: null,\n};\n\nconst config = {\n  type: Phaser.AUTO, width: window.innerWidth, height: window.innerHeight,\n  backgroundColor: '#0c0e10', scale: { mode: Phaser.Scale.NONE },\n  physics: { default: 'arcade', arcade: { gravity: { y: 0 }, debug: false } },\n  scene: { preload, create, update, render, startGame, showEndScreen, restartGame, },\n};\nconst ph = new Phaser.Game(config);\n\nfunction preload() {\n  this.load.spritesheet('player', 'assets/player.png', { frameWidth: G.CAR_WIDTH, frameHeight: G.CAR_HEIGHT });\n  this.load.spritesheet('wall',   'assets/wall.png',    { frameWidth: 8, frameHeight: 8 });\n  this.load.audio('engine',       'assets/engine.ogg');\n  this.load.audio('boom',         'assets/boom.ogg');\n}\n\nfunction create() {\n  const cam = this.cameras.main;\n  cam.setBounds(0, 0, G.TRACK_WIDTH, G.TRACK_HEIGHT);\n  this.physics.world.setBoundsCollision(true);\n\n  function addWall(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n    const w = Math.abs(x2-x1), h = Math.abs(y2-y1);\n    const sx = Math.min(x1,x2), sy = Math.min(y1,y2);\n    const line = wallGroup.create(sx, sy, 'wall');\n    line.displayWidth = w; line.displayHeight = h;\n    line.rotation = Math.atan2(h,w);\n  }\n\n  const wallGroup = this.add.group();\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80);\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2);\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+150, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2);\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH/2-120, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n\n  addWall(-G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, -G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n  addWall(G.TRACK_WIDTH-G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2-80, G.TRACK_WIDTH-G.CAR_WIDTH/2, G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+80);\n\n  const spawnX = G.TRACK_WIDTH/2 + G.LANE_OFFSET[1];\n  const spawnY = G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2;\n  const playerCar = this.physics.add.sprite(spawnX, spawnY, 'player');\n  playerCar.setCollideWorldBounds(false); playerCar.setBounce(0.25);\n  playerCar.setSize(G.CAR_WIDTH*0.7, G.CAR_HEIGHT*0.7,true);\n  playerCar.setOffset(G.CAR_WIDTH*0.15,G.CAR_HEIGHT*0.15);\n  this.anims.create({ key:'run', frames:this.anims.generateFrameNumbers('player',{start:0,end:3}), frameRate:10, repeat:-1 });\n  playerCar.anims.play('run');\n\n  cam.startFollow(playerCar, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0);\n\n  this.input.keyboard.on('keydown', e => {\n    if (G.gameOver || G.inputLocked) return;\n    if (e.code==='Space') { e.preventDefault(); }\n  });\n  this.input.keyboard.on('keyup', e => {\n    if (G.gameOver || G.inputLocked) return;\n    if (e.code==='Space'&&(!G.inBonus)) { e.preventDefault(); }\n  });\n\n  const hud = document.getElementById('hud');\n  hud.style.display='block';\n  const startBtn=document.getElementById('start-btn');\n  startBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(G.running)return;startGame();});\n  startBtn.addEventListener('touchend',()=>{if(G.running)return;startGame();});\n  const restartBtn=document.getElementById('restart-btn');\n  restartBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!G.gameOver)return;restartGame();});\n  restartBtn.addEventListener('touchend',()=>{if(!G.gameOver)return;restartGame();});\n\n  const scoreDisplay=document.getElementById('score-display');\n  const timerDisplay=document.getElementById('timer-display');\n  const bonusIndicator=document.getElementById('bonus-indicator');\n  const bonusProgress=document.getElementById('bonus-progress');\n\n  this.update=()=>{\n    if(!G.running)return;\n    const t=G.timer/G.maxTimer, lt=t*G.TRACK_WIDTH,rt=(1-t)*G.TRACK_WIDTH;\n    const px=playerCar.x-G.TRACK_WIDTH/2+lt,py=playerCar.y-G.TRACK_HEIGHT/2+t*G.TRACK_HEIGHT;\n    G.playerX=px; G.playerY=py; G.playerAngle=Math.atan2(rt-lt,1)-Math.PI/2;\n    G.playerSpeed=Math.hypot(px-G.playerX,py-G.playerY)*60;\n\n    let dx=0,dy=0;\n    if(this.input.keyboard.isDown(Phaser.Input.Keyboard.KeyCodes.LEFT)) dx-=1;\n    if(this.input.keyboard.isDown(Phaser.Input.Keyboard.KeyCodes.RIGHT)) dx+=1;\n    if(this.input.keyboard.isDown(Phaser.Input.Keyboard.KeyCodes.UP)) dy-=1;\n    if(this.input.keyboard.isDown(Phaser.Input.Keyboard.KeyCodes.DOWN)) dy+=1;\n\n    const len=Math.sqrt(dx*dx+dy*dy);\n    if(len>0){dx/=len;dy/=len;}\n\n    const ax=dx*G.ACCELERATION,ay=dy*G.ACCELERATION;\n    playerCar.setVelocity(ax,ay);\n\n    if(!dx&&!dy) playerCar.setVelocity(\n      playerCar.body.velocity.x*0.88, playerCar.body.velocity.y*0.88);\n\n    playerCar.body.velocity.y+=G.GRAVITY*dt;\n\n    if(playerCar.speed>G.MAX_SPEED)\n      playerCar.setVelocity(playerCar.body.velocity.x/G.MAX_SPEED*G.MAX_SPEED,\n                             playerCar.body.velocity.y/G.MAX_SPEED*G.MAX_SPEED);\n\n    const hitWall=wallGroup.getClosest(playerCar.x,playerCar.y,G.CAR_WIDTH*0.7);\n    if(hitWall){\n      playerCar.setVelocity(0,0);\n      playerCar.setPosition(hitWall.x+(playerCar.body.facing===1?1:-1)*G.CAR_WIDTH/2,\n                            hitWall.y+G.CAR_HEIGHT/2);\n    }\n\n    const bonus=wallGroup.getClosest(playerCar.x,playerCar.y,G.BONUS_RADIUS);\n    if(bonus){\n      const bx=bonus.x-playerCar.x,by=bonus.y-playerCar.y;\n      const dist=Math.sqrt(bx*bx+by*by);\n      if(dist<G.BONUS_RADIUS){\n        G.inBonus=true; bonusIndicator.classList.add('active');\n        const fill=Math.min(1,dist/G.BONUS_RADIUS);\n        bonusProgress.style.width=`${fill*100}%`;\n      }else{\n        const pullForce=Math.min(dist,G.BONUS_PULL);\n        playerCar.setVelocity(playerCar.body.velocity.x+bx/dist*pullForce*dt,\n                               playerCar.body.velocity.y+by/dist*pullForce*dt);\n      }\n    }else{G.inBonus=false; bonusIndicator.classList.remove('active'); bonusProgress.style.width='0%';}\n\n    scoreDisplay.textContent=`$${G.score}`;\n    timerDisplay.textContent=`${Math.round(G.timer).toString().padStart(2,'0')}s`;\n\n    if(G.timer<=0) endGame();\n  };\n}\n```",
