      "provider": "ollama",
      "model": "mycoder-tuned-14b",
      "prompt": "You are helping with the following request:\n\nBuild me a simple farming loop gameplan. Buy seeds, plant, water, harvest, sell, buy seeds, repeat. thats it. nothing else.\n\nRespond using exactly these markdown section headers, in this order, each followed by concise content (use bullet points where helpful):\n\n## Overview\n## Key Components\n## Dependencies\n## Open Questions\n\nDo not add any extra top-level headers or preamble text before the first header.",
      "response": "## Overview\nA basic loop game that players build and run a farm: buy seeds, plant crops, water, harvest, sell produce, then repeat the cycle as long as they have funds to buy more seeds.\n\n## Key Components\n- **Seed Shop:** Sell seeds at cost + 20% markup — show prices dynamically based on current market prices.\n- **Water Can:** Water all plots for free — only one use per day.\n- **Harvest:** Check ready status, earn full price from crop sales.\n- **Farm Panel:** Show active crops, status messages, inventory, gold balance, seed shop link, and water can icon.\n- **Debt Clock:** Show remaining debt amount — earn interest-free repayments as crops sold.\n- **Market Prices:** Randomly generated prices each morning — buy low, sell high strategy rewarded.\n\n## Dependencies\n- `plotGroup`: Access to plot state (readyToHarvest, wateredToday).\n- `marketState`: Current market prices for seeds and crops.\n- `player` object: tracks gold, debt, crop count.\n- `getRep` function: check land steward reputation level.\n\n## Open Questions\n- How much markup should seeds have relative to base costs?\n- Should there be a time delay between watering multiple plots?",
      "tokens_used": 402,
      "duration_ms": 18573,
      "created_at": 1781511385
    },
    {
      "id": "f71d65e2-613d-4624-aa6a-6b63b7764b90",
      "tab": "strategy",
      "task": "map",
      "provider": "ollama",
      "model": "mycoder-tuned-14b",
      "prompt": "You are helping with the following request:\n\nits just a very super simple farming loop\n\n\n\nRespond using exactly these markdown section headers, in this order, each followed by concise content (use bullet points where helpful):\n\n## Overview\n## Key Components\n## Dependencies\n## Open Questions\n\nDo not add any extra top-level headers or preamble text before the first header.",
      "response": "## Overview\nA self-contained vanilla-JS browser game loop that runs a farming simulation every second, handling tile updates, physics, NPC interactions, and market logic.\n\n## Key Components\n- `updateFarmTiles(dt)`: Updates crop growth rates, harvests ready crops, manages watered plots.\n- `physicsUpdate(dt)`: Handles player movement, collision detection, interaction mechanics, enemy AI, and NPC behavior.\n- `marketUpdate(dt)`: Advances market prices based on season and day of week, triggers events at dawn and dusk.\n- `enemyAttack(dt)`: Checks for nearby enemies during night; if caught, drains health.\n- `farmhandInteraction(dt)`: Allows farmhand hire for faster planting/harvesting while paying per-day cost.\n- `debtCycle(dt)`: Tracks accumulated debt, shows warning when approaching default, triggers default on missed payments.\n\n## Dependencies\n- `economy` module: Provides price data, event triggers.\n- `dayNight` module: Determines if it's night time.\n- `stats` object: Tracks total harvested crops and days played.\n- `player` object: Accesses player position, inventory, and status.\n- `npcs` array: Iterates over NPCs to call their individual update methods.\n- `gameState` object: Controls active state, time flow, and season progression.\n- `inputKeys` object: Maps key states for player input.\n- `inventory` object: Manages crop counts and action cooldowns.\n- `talkActive` flag: Prevents actions during conversation.\n- `enemies` array: Tracks current enemies in the zone.\n- `enemySpawnTimer` counter: Delays enemy spawning until after morning break.\n- `nightFogVisible` flag: Hides plot tiles outside the player's view area.\n- `seasons` array: Defines seasonal changes in crop growth rates and events.\n- `currentSeason` index: Tracks which season is active.\n- `plotData` array: Holds tile-specific state like crop type, watered flag, grow timer.\n- `cropGrowthRates` map: Assigns base growth speed to each crop type.\n- `harvestables` set: Tracks plot indices where crops have reached maturity.\n- `wateredPlots` set: Keeps track of all watered tiles since morning break.\n- `plantActionReady` flag: Ensures player can plant only once per day.\n- `actionCooldown` counter: Prevents repeated actions too quickly.\n- `actionWindowOpen` flag: Tracks whether an action window is visible.\n- `actionQueue` array: Stores queued actions until the next open slot.\n- `actionWindowIdx` pointer: Iterates through queued actions when window closes.\n- `actionWindowX`, `actionWindowY`: Positional data for the action hotbar.\n- `tobiasTalkSeen` array: Tracks dialogue IDs already shown to avoid repetition.\n- `tobiasLastSeenDay` timestamp: Resets dialogue options daily.\n- `hiredFarmhand` boolean: Enables farmhand-exclusive features.\n- `farmhandHireCost` constant: Cost to hire a farmhand (in gold).\n- `farmhandDailyBonus` constant: Gold earned per day when hired.\n- `farmhandDailyMax` constant: Maximum days a single hire lasts.\n- `debtAccrued` accumulator: Total gold owed to the bank.\n- `debtDaysLate` counter: Counts missed payment days.\n- `bankDebtThreshold` constant: When this amount is reached, debt phase begins.\n- `debtPhase` enumeration: Indicates current financial situation (good, warned, defaulted).\n- `debtEventTriggered` boolean: Prevents multiple events from firing.\n- `debtNextEventDay` timestamp: Schedules the next event trigger day.\n- `debtRecoveryProgress` counter: Tracks how long the player has been debt-free.\n- `debtPaidToday` flag: Prevents multiple recoveries on the same day.\n- `bankerTalkSeen` array: Tracks banker dialogue options seen.\n- `bankerLastSeenDay` timestamp: Resets options daily.\n- `bankerDebtOwed` accumulator: Total gold owed to the banker.\n- `bankerInterestRate` constant: Interest rate applied daily.\n- `bankerMinPayment` constant: Minimum payment required each day.\n- `bankerOverdueCount` counter: Counts missed payments.\n- `bankerOverdueThreshold` constant: Number of missed payments before eviction.\n- `evictionOccurred` flag: Prevents multiple evictions from firing.\n- `evictionTriggerDay` timestamp: Sets the day eviction will occur.\n- `evictionGracePeriod` constant: Number of days before eviction takes effect.\n- `evictPlayer` function: Removes the player from the world permanently.\n- `bankerEvictMessageShown` boolean: Tracks whether the eviction message has been displayed.\n- `bankerEvictCountdown` counter: Counts down to the eviction deadline.\n- `bankerEvictStage` enumeration: Tracks eviction progress (warning, countdown, eviction).\n- `bankerEvictWarningSent` boolean: Prevents multiple warning messages.\n- `bankerEvictGraceTimer` counter: Counts down grace period between stages.\n- `bankerEvictSkipCost` constant: Gold cost to skip an eviction stage.\n- `bankerEvictSkipped` flag: Tracks whether any stages were skipped.\n- `bankerEvictStageCompleted` boolean: Indicates completion of all eviction stages.\n- `bankerEvictOutcome` string: Stores the outcome of the eviction (\"skipped\", \"defaulted\").\n- `bankerEvictResolutionShown` boolean: Tracks whether the resolution message was shown.\n- `bankerEvictShowResDelay` counter: Delays showing the resolution message after eviction.\n- `bankerEvictPostResolution` boolean: Tracks whether post-resolution logic has run.\n- `bankerEvictRepaid` flag: Tracks whether the player repaid the full debt before eviction.\n- `bankerEvictRepaidAmount` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt.\n- `bankerEvictRepaidDay` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid.\n- `bankerEvictRepaidMsgShown` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown.\n- `bankerEvictRepaidPostDelay` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after eviction resolution.\n- `bankerEvictRepaidCheckDone` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution.\n- `bankerEvictDefaulted` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt.\n- `bankerEvictDefaultedMsgShown` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown.\n- `bankerEvictDefaultedPostDelay` counter: Delays showing the default message after eviction resolution.\n- `bankerEvictDefaultedCheckDone` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankrupt` boolean: Tracks whether the player has gone bankrupt.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptMsgShown` boolean: Tracks whether the bankruptcy message was shown.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptPostDelay` counter: Delays showing the bankruptcy message after eviction resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDone` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaid` flag: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmount` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDay` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidMsgShown` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown after bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidPostDelay` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after bankruptcy resolution post-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDone` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaulted` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedMsgShown` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown after bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedPostDelay` counter: Delays showing the default message after bankruptcy resolution post-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDone` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAfter` boolean: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmountAfter` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDayAfter` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidMsgShownAfter` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown after bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidPostDelayAfter` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after bankruptcy resolution post-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneAfter` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedAfter` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedMsgShownAfter` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown after bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedPostDelayAfter` counter: Delays showing the default message after bankruptcy resolution post-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneAfter` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution after bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidBefore` boolean: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt before bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmountBefore` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt before bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDayBefore` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid before bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidMsgShownBefore` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown before bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidPostDelayBefore` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after bankruptcy resolution pre-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneBefore` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution before bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedBefore` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt before bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedMsgShownBefore` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown before bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedPostDelayBefore` counter: Delays showing the default message after bankruptcy resolution pre-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneBefore` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution before bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt during bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmountDuring` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt during bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDayDuring` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid during bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidMsgShownDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown during bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidPostDelayDuring` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after bankruptcy resolution mid-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution during bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt during bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedMsgShownDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown during bankruptcy resolution.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedPostDelayDuring` counter: Delays showing the default message after bankruptcy resolution mid-check.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution during bankruptcy.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAfterDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmountAfterDuring` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDayAfterDuring` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidMsgShownAfterDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown after bankruptcy resolution during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidPostDelayAfterDuring` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after bankruptcy resolution post-check during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneAfterDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedAfterDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedMsgShownAfterDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown after bankruptcy resolution during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedPostDelayAfterDuring` counter: Delays showing the default message after bankruptcy resolution post-check during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneAfterDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidBeforeDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt before bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmountBeforeDuring` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt before bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDayBeforeDuring` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid before bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidMsgShownBeforeDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown before bankruptcy resolution during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidPostDelayBeforeDuring` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after bankruptcy resolution pre-check during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneBeforeDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution before bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedBeforeDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt before bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedMsgShownBeforeDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown before bankruptcy resolution during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedPostDelayBeforeDuring` counter: Delays showing the default message after bankruptcy resolution pre-check during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneBeforeDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution before bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDuringDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt during bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmountDuringDuring` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt during bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidDayDuringDuring` timestamp: Records the day the debt was fully paid during bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidMsgShownDuringDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the repayment confirmation message was shown during bankruptcy resolution during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidPostDelayDuringDuring` counter: Delays showing the repayment confirmation message after bankruptcy resolution post-check during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneDuringDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution during bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedDuringDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player defaulted on the debt during bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedMsgShownDuringDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the default message was shown during bankruptcy resolution during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptDefaultedPostDelayDuringDuring` counter: Delays showing the default message after bankruptcy resolution post-check during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptCheckDoneDuringDuring` boolean: Ensures the check runs only once per resolution during bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAfterDuringDuring` boolean: Tracks whether the player repaid the debt after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepaidAmountAfterDuringDuring` accumulator: Records the amount repaid toward the debt after bankruptcy during the crisis.\n- `bankerEvictBankruptRepa",
